WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.340
ఎనిమిది, Chatwoot.

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:02.220
Intercom బదులు,

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:03.180
live chat, email

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:04.100
ఒకే inbox లో.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:04.980
తొమ్మిది, Cap.

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:05.540
Loom కి

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:06.480
open-source alternative,

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:07.500
screen recording free.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:08.080
“REPO” అని

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:08.750
comment చేయండి,

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:09.640
9 links మీ DM కి

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:10.000
పంపిస్తా.
